001E76r 3               
001E76r 3               ; A dedicated 40-column inventory. Static labels live in the AUX script;
001E76r 3               ; quantities and possession flags are read afresh on each hidden-page draw.
001E76r 3               ; panel_column is free after the script and serves as the loop index here.
001E76r 3               full_inventory_panel:
001E76r 3  A9 03            lda #3
001E78r 3  20 rr rr         jsr full_text_address
001E7Br 3  AE 03 13         ldx held_item
001E7Er 3  F0 0F            beq @stocks             ; the static page says Vide for an empty hand
001E80r 3  BD rr rr         lda hud_hand_lo,x
001E83r 3  85 D6            sta menu_ptr
001E85r 3  BD rr rr         lda hud_hand_hi,x
